  { q: 'Do you cover all St Helens postcodes?', a: 'Yes. We cover WA9, WA10, WA11 and WA12, from the town centre and Thatto Heath to Haydock, Rainford and Newton-le-Willows. The price is the same everywhere, with no call-out fee.' },
